---
// src/pages/pro/about.astro — the story behind Raconteur (the dark desk).
// Copy is the classic About (boss's own voice), presented on the dark sheet.
import ProLayout from '../../layouts/ProLayout.astro';
---

<ProLayout title="About · Raconteur+" description="The story behind Raconteur, a home for storytellers.">
    <div class="pro-page pro-page-narrow">
        <article class="pro-sheet" data-pro-reveal>
            <header class="pro-sheet-head">
                <p class="pro-browser-kicker">About</p>
                <h1 class="pro-page-title">The story behind Raconteur</h1>
            </header>

            <div class="pro-sheet-body">
                <p class="pro-lede">
                    The idea of Raconteur began with a passing thought and a simple need to own
                    a short story publishing site where it can run, work and function the way I envisioned.
                    A site dedicated to the art of writing and the love for reading. A site dedicated to writers and readers.
                </p>

                <p>
                    So after several iterations, this is the result. A website where the only thing
                    that matters is the writing. Where a six-hundred-word flash piece sits
                    with the same dignity as a 14-line poem or a forty-thousand-word novella.
                    Where dark mode exists because reading at midnight should feel like reading at
                    midnight, not like staring into a flashlight.
                </p>

                <h2>What you'll find here</h2>

                <p>
                    Short stories, literary fiction, flash, poetry and novella.
                </p>

                <p>
                    There are no likes to chase here (You sure bud? because there are like buttons on each story and you should definitely give a like to celebrate each one).
                    No follower counts to inflate (that's a lie because there are follow buttons, so you should definitely follow each other).
                    No share buttons to abuse (ahem, oh my lawd, he can lie because you can share your stories and account with everyone).
                    No comment sections to duel in (just stop the cap).
                    Nonetheless, beyond the likes, the follows, the comments and the sharing, this is a site where writers publish work they're proud of, and readers show up for the love of the game itself.
                </p>

                <p>
                    So, if this looks like a place you'd want to write, or read, create an account and start writing.
                    Cheers!
                </p>

                <div class="pro-signature">
                    <p class="pro-sign-off">— Nzan Kikon</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </article>
    </div>
</ProLayout>

<style>
    .pro-page {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
        max-width: 1320px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 3.4rem 1.6rem 3rem;
    }

    .pro-page-narrow { max-width: 880px; }

    .pro-sheet {
        background: #0b0e11;
        border: 1px solid var(--pro-line);
        border-radius: 24px;
        padding: 3rem clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 3rem);
        box-shadow: var(--pro-shadow-card), var(--pro-inner-glow);
    }

    .pro-sheet-head { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.4rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--pro-line); }

    .pro-page-title {
        font-family: var(--pro-font);
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.4vw, 3rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        color: var(--pro-text);
        margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    }

    .pro-sheet-body { font-size: 1.08rem; }
    .pro-sheet-body p { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--pro-text-2); overflow-wrap: break-word; }
    .pro-lede { font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--pro-text) !important; }
    .pro-sheet-body h2 {
        font-family: var(--pro-font);
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 2.6rem 0 1.2rem;
        color: var(--pro-amber);
    }

    .pro-signature { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1.6rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--pro-line); text-align: right; }
    .pro-sign-off { font-family: var(--pro-font-read); font-style: italic; font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--pro-text) !important; margin: 0; }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .pro-page { padding: 2.2rem 1rem 2.4rem; }
    }
</style>
